        "original_id": "db0533f3-b6f2-585f-abda-a7cee14826c7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Sizemore, Wesley Snipes, Bruce Payne, Richard Nord, Alfre Woodard, Al Freeman Jr., Esther Rolle, Loretta Devine\n- Films: Born on the Fourth of July, Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man, Passenger 57, True Romance, Natural Born Killers, Strange Days, Heat, Saving Private Ryan, Red Planet, Black Hawk Down, Pearl Harbor, The Fugitive, Down in the Delta\n- Video Games: Grand Theft Auto: Vice City\n- Roles: supporting roles, film editor, cast members, voice role\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Sizemore is known for supporting roles in Born on the Fourth of July (1989), Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man (1991), Passenger 57 (1992), True Romance (1993), Natural Born Killers (1994), Strange Days (1995), Heat (1995), Saving Private Ryan (1998), Red Planet (2000), Black Hawk Down (2001), and Pearl Harbor (2001).\n- Passenger 57 stars Wesley Snipes and Bruce Payne.\n- Richard Nord is a film editor best known for The Fugitive and Passenger 57.\n- Down in the Delta stars Alfre Woodard, Al Freeman Jr., Esther Rolle, Loretta Devine, and Wesley Snipes.\n- Esther Rolle's appearance in Down in the Delta was her final film appearance before her death.\n- Tom Sizemore voiced Sonny Forelli in Grand Theft Auto: Vice City.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
